### 4H.1B.1: create/update exams check saved exams, effective classes and studies.
### Use a TEST course owned by your account. Set token/courseId in private HTTP Client env.
### Create the busy record BEFORE the proposed exam; reverse writers are 4H.1B.2.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Save one Tuesday class 07:00-09:00; expect 201 if free.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/class-schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}",
  "weekdays": [2],
  "startsOn": "2026-11-10",
  "endsOn": "2026-11-10",
  "startTime": "07:00",
  "endTime": "09:00",
  "timeZone": "Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh"
}

### 2. Expect 409 SCHEDULE_TIME_CONFLICT, conflict.kind CLASS. Nothing inserted.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/exams
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}",
  "kind": "FINAL",
  "format": "WRITTEN",
  "startsAt": "2026-11-10T08:00:00+07:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-11-10T10:00:00+07:00",
  "timeZone": "Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh"
}

### 3. Touch class end: expect 201. Record returned id/version for optional edits.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/exams
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}",
  "kind": "FINAL",
  "format": "WRITTEN",
  "startsAt": "2026-11-10T09:00:00+07:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-11-10T10:00:00+07:00",
  "timeZone": "Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh"
}

### 4. Expect 409 SCHEDULE_TIME_CONFLICT, conflict.kind EXAM.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/exams
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}",
  "kind": "MIDTERM",
  "format": "ONLINE",
  "startsAt": "2026-11-10T09:30:00+07:00",
  "endsAt": "2026-11-10T10:30:00+07:00",
  "timeZone": "Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh"
}

### 5. List confirms only the successful exam was saved (plus pre-existing records).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/exams?courseId={{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### More cases: docs/BACKEND-PHASE-4H1B1.md. Read latest version before updates/deletes.
### Do not publish private env files or tokens. No new migration in this phase.
